ent-ClothingHeadHelmetBasic = 安保頭盔 | security helmet
    .desc = Standard security gear. Protects the head from impacts, and comes with a visor which can be lowered to protect the eyes.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetMerc = 傭兵頭盔 | mercenary helmet
    .desc = The combat helmet is commonly used by mercenaries, is strong, light and smells like gunpowder and the jungle.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetSwat = SWAT 頭盔 | SWAT helmet
    .desc = An extremely robust helmet, commonly used by paramilitary forces. This one has the Nanotrasen logo emblazoned on the top.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetSwatSyndicate = SWAT 頭盔 | SWAT helmet
    .desc = An extremely robust helmet, commonly used by paramilitary forces. It is adorned in a nefarious red and black stripe pattern.
    .suffix = Syndicate
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetRiot = 輕型防暴頭盔 | light riot helmet
    .desc = It's a helmet specifically designed to protect against close range attacks, it has a foldable visor.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetBombSuit = 防爆服頭盔 | bombsuit helmet
    .desc = A heavy helmet designed to withstand the pressure generated by a bomb and any fragments the bomb may produce.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetJanitorBombSuit = 清潔人員防爆服頭盔 | janitorial bombsuit helmet
    .desc = A heavy helmet designed to withstand explosions formed from reactions between chemicals.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetCult = 邪教頭盔 | cult helmet
    .desc = A robust, evil-looking cult helmet.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetSpaceNinja = 太空忍者頭盔 | space ninja helmet
    .desc = What may appear to be a simple black garment is in fact a highly sophisticated nano-weave helmet. Standard issue ninja gear.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetTemplar = 騎士頭盔 | knight helmet
    .desc = Decorative helmet fashioned to resemble the knights of old.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetThunderdome = 雷霆穹頂頭盔 | thunderdome helmet
    .desc = Let the battle commence!
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetWizardHelm = 巫師頭盔 | wizard helm
    .desc = Strange-looking helmet that most certainly belongs to a real magic user.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetFire = 消防頭盔 | fire helmet
    .desc = An atmos tech's best friend. Provides some heat resistance and looks cool.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetAtmosFire = atmos 消防頭盔 | atmos fire helmet
    .desc = An atmos fire helmet, able to keep the user cool in any situation.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetLing = 幾丁質頭盔 | chitinous helmet
    .desc = An all-consuming chitinous mass of armor.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetERTLeader = ERT 領隊頭盔 | ERT leader helmet
    .desc = An in-atmosphere helmet worn by the leader of a Nanotrasen Emergency Response Team. Has blue highlights.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetERTSecurity = ERT 安全頭盔 | ERT security helmet
    .desc = An in-atmosphere helmet worn by security members of the Nanotrasen Emergency Response Team. Has red highlights.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetERTMedic = ERT 醫療人員頭盔 | ERT medic helmet
    .desc = An in-atmosphere helmet worn by medical members of the Nanotrasen Emergency Response Team. Has white highlights.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetERTEngineer = ERT 工程師安全帽 | ERT engineer helmet
    .desc = An in-atmosphere helmet worn by engineering members of the Nanotrasen Emergency Response Team. Has orange highlights.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetERTJanitor = ERT 清潔工安全帽 | ERT janitor helmet
    .desc = An in-atmosphere helmet worn by janitorial members of the Nanotrasen Emergency Response Team. Has dark purple highlights.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetRaid = 辛迪加突襲頭盔 | syndicate raid helmet
    .desc = An armored helmet for use with the syndicate raid suit. Very stylish.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetBone = 骨製頭盔 | bone helmet
    .desc = Cool-looking helmet made of skull of your enemies.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetPodWars = 「鐵甲 II」頭盔 | ironclad II helmet
    .desc = An ironclad II helmet, a relic of the pod wars.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetJustice = 正義之盔 | justice helm
    .desc = Advanced security gear. Protects the station from ne'er-do-wells.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetJusticeEmpty = { ent-ClothingHeadHelmetJustice }
    .desc = { ent-ClothingHeadHelmetJustice.desc }
    .suffix = Empty
ent-ActionToggleJusticeHelm = 切換正義頭盔 | Toggle Justice Helm
    .desc = Toggles the justice helm on and off.
ent-CardHelmet = 紙板製頭盔 | cardboard helmet
    .desc = A medieval helmet built from cardboard.
